        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize the state layout for substepping. The state variables are organized as follows: </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;Substepping_F_n&quot; (9 variables): <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_finite_strain_1_1_deformation" kindref="compound">Deformation</ref> gradient at the start of the global step (F_n).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;materialstate&quot; (baseMaterial-&gt;<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_finite_strain_1a7ad41a3c35aead0da007341ff2152ef4" kindref="member">getNumberOfRequiredStateVars()</ref> variables): State variables required by the wrapped base material. The total number of state variables is the sum of the above. The layout is finalized at the end of this function. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
